{
    "title": "Days To | Countdown",
    "description": "Days To is a modern mix of a countdown app and a reminder app for keeping track of all your special events and moments. Whether it's a wedding, anniversary, birthday, holiday, graduation, exam, or retirement, our app makes it easy to count down how many days until the date!\r\n\r\nOur user-friendly app comes with home screen widgets that let you display your important events on your home screen for easy access. Plus, with notifications that remind you of important dates, you'll never forget an event again. With the Days To Countdown app, stay organized while reaching the milestones of your life!\r\n\r\nDays To is also highly customizable as much as it's functional. You can customize your events with backgrounds, colors, frames, and fonts to make each moment uniquely yours!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Simple Set up\r\nEasily add your countdowns and start counting down.\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Home Screen Widget\r\nEasily access your countdowns on your home screen with our countdown widget! You can also personalize it with text styles, colors, and backgrounds.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Reminder Notifications\r\nSet up reminder notifications individually for each occasion in the way it suits. Choose when you get notification freely with six different options. Let our app help you remember!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd01 Repeat Options\r\nSet your events to repeat annually, monthly, or weekly. For example, you can choose to repeat annually if it happens every year like a wedding anniversary, Valentine's Day, Christmas, or Halloween.\r\n\r\n\u2601\ufe0f Cloud Synchronization\r\nSecurely sync and back up your events with your Google account. Enjoy using our app on your other Android devices with multi-device support.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Customizations\r\nCustomize your dates with various colors, frames, and font options to add your personal touch!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf04 Backgrounds\r\nChoose your background from our selection of stunning images or use your photos to make each one of them even more special!\r\n\r\nDownload now and join thousands of users and make your special moments unforgettable with Days To!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Days To is a modern mix of a countdown app and a reminder app for keeping track of all your special events and moments. Whether it&#39;s a wedding, anniversary, birthday, holiday, graduation, exam, or retirement, our app makes it easy to count down how many days until the date!<br><br>Our user-friendly app comes with home screen widgets that let you display your important events on your home screen for easy access. Plus, with notifications that remind you of important dates, you&#39;ll never forget an event again. With the Days To Countdown app, stay organized while reaching the milestones of your life!<br><br>Days To is also highly customizable as much as it&#39;s functional. You can customize your events with backgrounds, colors, frames, and fonts to make each moment uniquely yours!<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 Simple Set up<br>Easily add your countdowns and start counting down.<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f Home Screen Widget<br>Easily access your countdowns on your home screen with our countdown widget! You can also personalize it with text styles, colors, and backgrounds.<br><br>\ud83d\udd14 Reminder Notifications<br>Set up reminder notifications individually for each occasion in the way it suits. Choose when you get notification freely with six different options. Let our app help you remember!<br><br>\ud83d\udd01 Repeat Options<br>Set your events to repeat annually, monthly, or weekly. For example, you can choose to repeat annually if it happens every year like a wedding anniversary, Valentine&#39;s Day, Christmas, or Halloween.<br><br>\u2601\ufe0f Cloud Synchronization<br>Securely sync and back up your events with your Google account. Enjoy using our app on your other Android devices with multi-device support.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Customizations<br>Customize your dates with various colors, frames, and font options to add your personal touch!<br><br>\ud83c\udf04 Backgrounds<br>Choose your background from our selection of stunning images or use your photos to make each one of them even more special!<br><br>Download now and join thousands of users and make your special moments unforgettable with Days To!",
